  "description": "IZATEK crystallizes in the cubic crystal system with space group I -4 3 d. Reported CIF formula moiety: C54 H60 Dy3 N30 Ni3 O23 1+,Cl1 O4 1-,3(C1 H4 O1),3(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Ni1 (Ni) has 0 O neighbors; Dy1G (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Ni1G (Ni) has 0 O neighbors; Dy1J (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Ni1J (Ni) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 4 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.813-3.813 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.21-110.33°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C63H81ClDy3Ni3N33O30.",
